/*
 * Root module for template declaration dispatch.
 *
 * TemplateDeclaration provides the high-level entry points used to declare
 * template-instantiated symbols. After template solving and rewriting are
 * complete, this module dispatches to the appropriate declaration module:
 *
 *   - TemplateMethodDeclaration  for method templates,
 *   - TemplateCtorDeclaration    for constructor templates,
 *   - TemplateBasicDeclaration   for all other template
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::declare
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/declare.yr
